<title>USA: Paxson Comm issues $150 mln preferred stock.</title>
<headline>Paxson Comm issues $150 mln preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of cumulative exchangeable preferred stock was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager BT Securities Corp.</p>
<p>ISSUER PAXSON COMMUNICATIONS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 12.50 PCT  MATURITY 10/31/06</p>
<p>TYPE PREFERRED     ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 04/31/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY N/R     SPREAD N/A	  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P N/R				 CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT 112.50</p>
<p>SIX-YEAR PAY-IN-KIND</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
